# an unknown key at the root, with a value
$ skills list --registry <WORLD>/docs/01.yaml
exit: 0
--- stdout ---
alpha	custom	overlay-only	claude
--- stderr ---
warning: registry fields left unread: line 1: unknown top-level key "extra"

